WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
Choose the test layer
that exposes the behavior.

00:00:03.175 --> 00:00:07.840
Service tests can check idempotency,
concurrency and journal outcomes directly.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:13.360
A browser journey checks pending states,
the retry action and the final message.

00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:18.400
Existing Selenium and Appium suites
remain where they are owned and useful.

00:00:18.509 --> 00:00:22.960
Settlement reconciliation and provider
checks stay scheduled separately.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.240
Replacing the browser framework
does not create another settlement

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:29.200
environment or remove
a vendor access constraint.
